  "details": "I discovered this problem when I first used an AV2.0 avatar, then an AV3.0 avatar, then reverted back to the original avatar.\nIt goes into the same state as desktop mode and does not reflect any tracking (at least from my perspective).\nTo temporarily resolve this issue, you will need to re-join the instance.\nEven if Unity2020 is updated in the future and shaders are wiped out and AV2.0 will not be supported in the first place, this bug will cause problems when testing old avatars with the new IK, forcing you to re join instance them every time.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
